{"5087090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AlchemyOClock", "steam_appid": 5087090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5144090], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an alchemy incremental game: the furnace never rests, recipes unlock layer by layer, and your workshop keeps growing.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your years are running out. What you brew isn’t only Spirit Stones—it’s longevity pills that push life a little further against heaven.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fan once. Gamble the heat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a recipe, load the ingredients, light the fire, and open the furnace in the ripe window.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe for steady gains, or risk it for premium peaks. Blowouts still leave Calamity Ash and partial refunds—you can keep brewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-game, hire alchemy apprentices and unlock auto-feeding and heat control.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shift from frantic clicking to managing the board: queue recipes, steward resources, grow the workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allotted years run out. When you pass on—by lifespan’s end or by choice—Dao Marks remain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unseal jackpot pills to bank Dao Marks, then rewrite the next life on the skill tree—life after life, your cultivation chronicle takes shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew a batch. Take the risk. Live again.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an alchemy incremental game: the furnace never rests, recipes unlock layer by layer, and your workshop keeps growing.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your years are running out. What you brew isn’t only Spirit Stones—it’s longevity pills that push life a little further against heaven.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fan once. Gamble the heat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a recipe, load the ingredients, light the fire, and open the furnace in the ripe window.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe for steady gains, or risk it for premium peaks. Blowouts still leave Calamity Ash and partial refunds—you can keep brewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-game, hire alchemy apprentices and unlock auto-feeding and heat control.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shift from frantic clicking to managing the board: queue recipes, steward resources, grow the workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allotted years run out. When you pass on—by lifespan’s end or by choice—Dao Marks remain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unseal jackpot pills to bank Dao Marks, then rewrite the next life on the skill tree—life after life, your cultivation chronicle takes shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew a batch. Take the risk. Live again.</p>", "short_description": "An alchemy incremental game: fan the flames, open the furnace, and brew against a running lifespan—hunting recipes that truly buy you more years. Apprentices take over the busywork; when life ends you reincarnate with Dao Marks intact—live again, brew again.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087090/e5d29e1c7e06a0c322a5c8d801f18f7370ae3c60/header.jpg?t=1787908261", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087090/b74552bfc521d7249c82aa7ad203304831c6f04a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787908261", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087090/b74552bfc521d7249c82aa7ad203304831c6f04a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787908261", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and